--[[ 
99%W Panel Script for Roblox FPS Game
Features:
- Movable & minimizable panel
- Toggle ESP (players, distance, guns)
- WalkSpeed & JumpPower
- Aim Stick (Body)
- Head-Mounted Aim
- Aim FOV (0-100%)
- No Universal Clip / Wall Hack
- Real-time FPS display
]]

